@description Rea-Sixty
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.2.3
@changelog
  - Codename: Did you try turning it off and on again?
  - Fix: macOS 26 meter stutter — the Inserts overlay located targets with a full-mixer pixel sweep; on macOS 26 each probe round-trips through the window server, stalling the main thread (peak meters + edit cursor hitched every 1-2 s while mixing). Now finds each strip from track geometry (~60 probes/track instead of ~8000)
  - New: focused panel — click a CS/BC plug-in name to float/unfloat it; persistent Selection/Encoder mode indicator + mode-change flash; Settings / HUD / CS-BC cycle buttons
  - New: focused panel drag-to-arrange elements (per-block order + line breaks, persisted) + centre horizontally / vertically
  - New: focused panel docking that survives a restart — re-attaches to its REAPER docker next launch
  - Fix: favourites copy only mapped parameters (on by default) — carries only params mapped to a UC1 control, not unmapped plug-in internals matched by name (e.g. the SSL channel's Auto-Makeup setting)
  - Fix: favourites filter open → off across plug-ins — a fully-open low/high-pass lands on the destination's discrete "out" instead of the nearest frequency
  - New: favourites preserve the SSL EQ-Filter-Dyn routing order (incl. Ext-Sidechain) + EXT FUNCS on cycle — carried across switches, restored per-favourite in own-settings mode, saved with the project
  - Fix: per-favourite memory stays consistent across copy/own mode switches
